WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.970
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.910
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.980
I can say love

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.710
will you love me?

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:23.230
Enemy sighted!

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:29.980
Identified as a Good Luck Ship!

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:31.690
This one's even fancier than the ones before...!

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.650
Doesn't it make you feel like revering it?

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:35.120
Can I shoot?!

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:37.120
I understand how you feel, but...

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:38.420
Captain?

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.760
Tennan-sensei?!

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:44.770
I know you're there!

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:47.230
Da Ruma will be pleased when I--

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:52.040
Amane-san...

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.700
I still haven't finished my line...!

00:01:56.180 --> 00:02:02.180
Show

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:09.120
B-17!

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.280
Come on, one more!

00:02:15.430 --> 00:02:16.520
C-7!

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:21.860
--E-13! A-2!--A triple!

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.160
They keep dodging!

00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:29.480
What's the matter? Do you think you can sink my ship that easily?!

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:31.910
E-36!

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:35.110
Yes! Bingo!

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:39.410
Gravity wave detected! Right next to us?!

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:44.490
--They're coming straight at us!--Strengthen the shields! Hurry!

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.300
Main system's down! The core's taken a direct hit!

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.670
Fuku!

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:09.280
To think that the Kamidake would lose...

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:15.120
And Seiryo-kun being on board was a surprise enough, but as its captain?

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:19.020
I hear it's because Tennan Group has made a formal agreement with them.

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:25.660
Unbelievable. They won't pay the ransom but they'll strike a business deal.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:30.470
Don't hold back for politeness' sake! Go on!

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:34.980
But we still haven't defeated the Kamidake for good!

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:39.880
It was unfortunate that he got away just before you could destroy him.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.920
Had it been any other way, he would not be fit to be called my rival...

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:49.010
But next time I will track him down and finish him off with a triple bingo!

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:54.450
You're so dependable.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:59.430
Is everyone having a great time?!

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.400
This is a victory party, you know!

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:05.630
I'm so glad I became a pirate!

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:10.110
But luckily Seina-kun and the others made it out unharmed!

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:11.610
Indeed.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:13.610
But the Kamidake has been seriously damaged.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:15.750
The core also appears to be impaired,

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.950
so it sounds like repairs will take some time.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:22.050
Fuku-chan suffered some feedback from the Kamidake, so...

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:27.060
No. Be quiet and behave yourself.

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:30.130
Washu-sama says that she should be fine once the core matures,

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:34.930
but to be careful while she's still growing.

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:38.170
I suppose you could call it good old bed rest.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.410
Really?

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.840
But it really pisses me off that we lost to that moron Seiryo!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.250
He's not that stupid...

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:47.250
Just remembering him is making me mad!

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.880
I'm gonna go let off some steam!

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:54.990
Damn it! Damn it!

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:59.260
But to think that all of Amane's shots would miss...

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:02.130
We need to come up with a counter-measure...

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.400
Big Brother! We have a guest!

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.590
Eh?

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:09.400
You're...!

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:12.460
It's good to see you all again!

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:15.140
Amane-san in a fashion show?

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:19.310
Yes. This next show is the unveiling of new uniforms

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:23.950
for GP and Academy employees, so I would really like Amane to be in it.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:24.980
I see...

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.490
But Amane isn't...

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:28.220
I know.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:32.360
To be honest, we really wish she would quit this dangerous job of hers.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:38.570
But it really is important to respect her decisions...

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:42.140
After all, both my husband and Amane are as stubborn as they come.

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:46.170
Amane-san told me before that she liked working as a model!

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:47.610
Is that so?

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.040
But you know how she is...

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:52.450
Yes. I don't think she will agree so easily...

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:55.350
Then it's simple!

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:59.090
I refuse.

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:03.160
I'm a member of the GP! I can't be a model now...!

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:05.190
With the Kamidake undergoing repairs,

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:07.160
you are unable to fly any more missions, correct?

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.630
So you can make a special exception just this once...

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:10.830
I don't want to!

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.270
But it's an order.

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:13.830
I don't wanna do things I don't wanna do!

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.240
Is that so?

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:17.240
Say, Seina-kun.

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:21.710
Wouldn't you like to see how she looks as a model?

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:25.280
Well... I do, but...

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:29.080
My friends told me before that she was really pretty...

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:32.310
There you have it. So what will it be?

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:36.960
Well, when Seina puts it like that...

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.430
Yay! Amane-san!

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:39.160
I see.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:43.530
Well, the show is tomorrow, so let us go and make the arrangements.

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:45.120
Tomorrow?!

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:01.140
--So this is the place?--Amane!

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.020
Dad...

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:05.850
Amane!

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:07.620
I'm so glad you came back!

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:11.930
You're such a loyal daughter by quitting the GP and being a model again!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.460
Whoa, hold on there!

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:15.300
Now the Kaunaq family can rest at ease!

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:17.930
Listen to me!

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:20.700
I appreciate your help!

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:23.940
I thought you said you two respected her decision to join the GP...?

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:26.670
I do, anyway...

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.580
Stupid Dad!

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:32.710
Um, I'm sorry...

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:36.250
It's all because I said I wanted to see you as a model...

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.250
That's right! I'm doing this thing for you, Seina!

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:41.420
You better be grateful!

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:44.480
I will! I already am...

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:48.690
Great! Then let's get going!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.160
Um...

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:02.310
How dare Amane-san use my absence as an opportunity

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:04.710
to get all over him like that!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.950
But is it really OK for us to be doing this?

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:10.080
We were instructed to stay there and wait for further orders...

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:14.050
Don't worry about it! We left her in charge of Fuku-san's nursing!

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:16.260
Plus I took care of the troublemaker!

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:20.690
The old ladies are gone, so let's have lots of fun together!

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:24.690
Lemme go! Come on! They're still not finished changing clothes!

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.910
This brings back memories...

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:36.380
Yeah, my Amane finally decided to come back!

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:39.010
I don't mean to boast, but she's the loveliest girl in all of space!

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:42.580
So I need you to give her the very best spots and the very best outfits!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.550
Dad...!

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:48.180
He doesn't have a clue!

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:52.360
He's just happy that you're back, Amane!

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:55.930
Jun! Long time no see! How're you doing?!

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:59.900
Great! Everyone was so excited when they heard you were coming!

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:02.270
Is she one of Amane-san's model friends?

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:03.800
It would appear so.

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:07.170
Are you going to use this show to start your comeback as a model?

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:11.980
Uh, no, this time is just because of orders from my superiors...

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.410
Oh, that's too bad.

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:21.550
Today's the unveiling of the new uniforms for GP employees.

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:24.420
The 1st half will be the show and the 2nd half will be the battle simulation.

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:26.030
Everyone got that?

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:26.860
Yes!

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:31.660
Pretty much everything is here in the script, but there are a few changes.

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:35.460
First, the opening. After the music plays, the stage lights come on...

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:40.570
Don't you get the feeling we've entered dangerous territory?

00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:44.240
But this is the only way to keep Amane-san under surveillance!

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:47.510
"Surveillance" is a little...

00:09:47.510 --> 00:09:49.280
Thank you for your hard work with the cleaning.

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:51.220
Kiriko-san, Ryoko-san.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:58.760
Fuku-chan! Time to eat!

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:00.790
Huh?

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.320
Where's NB?

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:23.880
I'm really amazed!

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.220
By what?

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:28.150
It's like you're not the normal Amane-san I know...

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:30.460
It's almost like you're a real model!

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:33.360
I was a real model.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.990
No, that's not what I meant...

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:40.870
It's sort of strange.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:45.540
Maybe it's the nervousness 'cuz it's been so long since my last real show.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:49.310
For some reason it makes me feel nostalgic and happy...

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:52.050
Really?

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:56.540
I guess I don't hate this job after all...

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:03.920
OK, we're starting the rehearsal now!

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:19.240
But as long as I'm a Kaunaq I'll never know how far my true skills go.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:23.610
I guess I don't hate this job after all...

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.850
What's wrong?

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:30.920
Nothing. Is it OK for you to be up here during rehearsal?

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:33.850
I've already finished my turn.

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:36.620
I'm free until the battle simulation.

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:38.420
Oh, really?

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.300
Looks like she's not here today...

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:49.570
Eh? Who's "she"...?

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:54.810
There used to be this bimbo who'd get on my case every chance she could.

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:57.040
Oh, my...

00:11:57.640 --> 00:12:00.080
Outsiders aren't allowed here.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:01.050
Here she is.

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:02.220
NB!

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.320
I'm so happy...!

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.650
Oh, and who might this be?

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:10.560
It looks like Amane-san, but it couldn't be because she resigned!

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:11.760
You make me sick!

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:15.060
She was scared of being compared with me so she ran off to join the GP!

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:18.330
Oh, silly me, I mean I heard she decided to change jobs!

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:20.600
Are you here to see the show, then?

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:24.370
I'm making a special appearance just this once! As a model!

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.070
Really?!

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:30.510
Ah, so they've invited a member of the GP to be a model, have they?

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:34.470
I guess they don't want real models making their uniforms look too good.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:38.150
You think you're so big by showing up to rehearsal late...!

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:43.780
When you're a top model like me, there is no need for rehearsal!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:48.260
Oh, my! What marvelous muscles!

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:50.630
They're hard, fat, and seem heavy!

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:54.530
And just feel this rough skin!

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:59.870
Your father's position won't save you once you step onto that stage!

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:04.940
Well, try hard not to embarrass yourself today!

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:06.150
Why you...!

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:07.250
Amane-san!

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:09.220
Let's go, Poochie.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.180
Poochie goes woof!

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:19.990
I don't really have any regrets.

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:24.600
I... like your hands, Amane-san.

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:29.840
I... really like your hands!

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:34.940
Both my mom and Tenchi-senpai have rough hands because of their work.

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:39.950
I can't really explain it, but they're comforting somehow...

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:42.180
Seina...

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:46.410
And besides, I think you're much prettier than that lady just now!

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:53.190
What in the world am I saying?

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:54.260
Thanks.

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:56.090
You're welcome...

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:00.600
Now, now. What are you two doing?

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.270
Principal!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:07.440
Listen. Today is the unveiling of new clothing designs for GP members.

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:12.280
Show us all what walking mannequins can't do!

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:15.270
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:28.390
Ladies and gentlemen! Now is the moment you've been waiting for!

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:32.630
The new fashion show for the employees of the GP and the Academy!

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:47.200
I'll show you the difference between an amateur and a professional!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:15:00.680
First off is a presentation of ordinary office worker attire!

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:10.630
Top model Miss Vega shows off an evening dress!

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:24.020
Next is Amane Kaunaq, making her first modeling appearance in 3 years!

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:26.990
She's sporting a formal GP uniform!

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:37.130
You're so beautiful, Amane! Absolutely gorgeous!

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:38.690
Dad...!

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:44.170
--Why do we...--...have to do this?

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:47.910
Your travel expenses haven't been paid so keep working hard!

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:51.010
Do so and I'll overlook your breach of orders!

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:52.550
Yes, ma'am...

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:56.570
Now it's time for GP combat wear!

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:06.120
Chic and beautiful, yet something to be feared! The beast-like line!

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:12.030
This may perhaps be the ultimate in beauty!

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:16.300
This show makes them look stunning!

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:17.940
That it does.

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:20.670
There's no point to them if they're not usable in actual combat.

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:23.700
Yes. You are quite right.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:34.950
Seina. Could you hand me that...

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:40.230
You don't normally get to see top models in the nude,

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:42.500
so why don't you get in as much looking as you can?

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.930
No, that's okay!

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:48.270
I'm looking as much as I can! Nice angle!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.940
You stop looking!

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:52.340
This kinda feels good too...

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:56.040
Amane-san! Is it really OK to alter this outfit?

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:59.650
Yeah. I wanna loosen it up around the joints.

00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:02.180
Right now it's hard to move my elbows and shoulders in it.

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:04.850
Also, get me some gloves that are one size larger.

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:05.820
Got it!

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:07.790
Oh, my...

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.520
You're having them alter your clothes now?

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:14.560
Won't that go against the clothing line we worked so hard to show off?

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:16.800
Listen! Functionality over appearance!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.730
That's what uniforms are for, you know!

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:21.200
Miss Vega...

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:25.240
I looked around at all the other girls but your body's the best one there is!

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.140
But of course!

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:30.910
You really must show me this "functionality over appearance" thing!

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:35.810
Amane-san...

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:41.550
2nd-class GP detective Amane Kaunaq will now show off a new outfit

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:43.720
in a battle simulation.

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:45.930
I wonder what kind of erotic get-up it'll be this time?!

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:46.960
This is heart-stirring!

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.060
I don't know about you, but a different part of me is stirring!

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:50.590
You're starting to sound like a middle-aged guy, you know that?

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:15.550
Is she trying to throw a wet blanket on the entire crowd or what?!

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:19.550
I'm not standing on this stage as a model.

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:24.330
I'm standing here as a member of the GP!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.100
Seina! Watch me!

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.830
She's really something.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:30.200
Is everything ready?

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:31.870
Anytime you are!

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:33.210
OK, start her up then!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.540
Roger!

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:52.520
Look at that...!

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:11.110
Here goes nothing!

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:31.620
Got 'im!

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:36.600
Amane-san! Look out!

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.390
You did it, Amane-san!

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:22.510
What did you think?

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:24.020
You were amazing!

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:26.650
You looked really pretty!

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:28.620
It was all thanks to you, Seina!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:30.490
No, I didn't do anything...

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:32.390
It was all you, Amane-san!

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:35.590
Oh, come on,

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:41.230
I can do something that simple too...!

00:20:41.230 --> 00:20:43.200
That's an actual simulator used by the GP!

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:45.040
It's not for amateurs!

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:46.370
Shut up!

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:49.480
I've taken self-defense training too, you know!

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:52.240
I've been doing special training for this very day!

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:54.710
Hold on a second! This wasn't in the schedule,

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:56.580
but Vega is making another appearance!

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:03.020
That's right! It doesn't matter where the enemy comes from, I'm...

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:15.000
You aren't going to stop her?

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.540
I doubt I could.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:21.400
She has already started down her own path.

00:21:23.140 --> 00:21:26.170
--Oh, darling...!--There, there...

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:31.080
It's all over! I can't wait to get home and take a bath!

00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:33.650
You worked hard today, Amane-san!

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:37.590
Say, Seina. Why don't you take a bath with me and give me a massage...?

00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:39.960
Eh?! Uh...

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:43.400
I was so happy when you called me pretty...

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:44.460
Amane!

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:48.970
Your special assignment is over so get away from Seina-dono this instant!

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:52.040
What does it matter to you? You're not here...

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:55.070
--Amane!--Get away from him!

00:21:55.070 --> 00:21:58.740
Huh? I get the feeling I'm forgetting something...

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:03.450
More! More!

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:06.420
Why did it turn out like this?!

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:27.020
You're the worst, most hopeless,most unlucky boy in all of space...

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:34.890
Even against your will...(You fail.)

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.700
Even when you're gentle...(You're extremely clumsy.)

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:41.200
With too much fighting spirit,in vain, it's all coming to nothing...

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:44.190
You're gonna fail.

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:48.040
Carefully...(So irritating!)

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:50.040
Or with violence...(Ow! Quit it!)

00:22:50.040 --> 00:23:01.110
You're the worst and most hopeless...you're a lost cause.

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:10.830
You're the worst and the most hopeless...

00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:15.170
You're an unlucky boy...

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:20.510
But, any way, I'm with you.

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:25.670
So, more and more,keep on doing what you do!

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:35.210
The Good Luck Ship raids have shifted the galaxy's balance of power!

00:23:35.210 --> 00:23:37.940
The GP's working on a way to resolve the crisis, as is Seto-sama.

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:42.350
But Tennan-sensei! I don't think you should use that for your ship's name!

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:44.180
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!

00:23:44.180 --> 00:23:45.580
"The Ship that Brings Luck"
